  <compounddef id="Frame-based-example" kind="example">
    <compoundname>Frame-based</compoundname>
    <briefdescription>
<para>allocation pattern </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>allocation pattern <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>arena<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacecslt_1ad55f4168d9f1832627c6d75e60d14a6c" kindref="member">cslt::move</ref>(<ref refid="classcslt_1_1ArenaAllocator_1ab71e5fc5e1cf3e9b07ad7208465a7b0f" kindref="member">cslt::ArenaAllocator::Heap</ref>(1024<sp/>*<sp/>1024).value());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">while</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(running)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Allocate<sp/>temporary<sp/>data<sp/>for<sp/>this<sp/>frame</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>temp_data<sp/>=<sp/>arena-&gt;alloc(4096).value();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>process_frame(temp_data);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Free<sp/>all<sp/>frame<sp/>allocations<sp/>at<sp/>once<sp/>(very<sp/>fast!)</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>arena-&gt;reset();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>save() To create checkpoint before temporary allocations </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>restore() To rollback to checkpoint instead of full reset <programlisting filename="Frame-based"></programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
